 # C-c native campaign preparation driver report
 
-Status: **STATIC IMPLEMENTATION COMPLETE; DRIVER NOT EXECUTED.**
+Status: **STATIC FIX 3 COMPLETE; CORRECTED DRIVER NOT EXECUTED.**
 
-The bounded driver is `prepare_c_c_campaign.py`, 53,367 bytes, SHA-256 `3ca3a90c81380b99532d5fd79dda18de14a2d49700ac20dbfb06425ef0c8d2da`. It is frozen for bounded independent re-review. The earlier approved direct installed-binary start was rejected by Windows before Python or the driver ran; no campaign/root/resource/config/manifest/policy/preview was created.
+The bounded driver is `prepare_c_c_campaign.py`, 57,121 bytes, SHA-256 `2ca91a126701fdbd692c79181a6ef28a1dc9d4d81dc6a54b102b1f04e91ff5be`. It is frozen for bounded independent re-review. The earlier approved direct installed-binary start was rejected by Windows before Python ran. A later approved start through `py -3.13 -B` authenticated the review and interpreter gates, then stopped in the pre-import preflight when ordinary Windows path handling falsely reported an existing 264-character original blob path as absent. Python raised before project imports or destination writes, and the selected artifact and resource roots remained absent. The corrected driver has not been executed.
 
 ## Fixed authority and execution gate
 
-The driver pins the final P1-P4 independent source review `4e4991b0dfcdcfe980b2bd2655ba5bf88af6300c956c179d2e258014dd1fef4b`, reviewed-source authority `d896bce97945b9438bed6f4837fd16213530338563e3bbd728eafaa8a9fbbe09`, all 22 exact source hashes, principal readiness `14f385172f29dccf258d4be4802137724774e57b267ebbac4201a4945c01aed2`, independent readiness `50cd6d863fb3f6235af3a47fcf90fe4d21a5425c8852055b470abe9c95634f3a`, preparation-tool evidence `c329ade7d4f50a705bd6992da477870f4d1e0c3e4862feffe0f855d7c3fb243d`, native-launch notes `1ea2eabd612c94d3992f0485a9cc5ec387e4fd465e44fb1c48a97abbc06ef49c`, principal interpreter correction `10b7a1468bcc0e4f31bf9c73432be9f29eab5510df6c34a8c849e53466a76fe5`, and launcher-resolution evidence `11caf55b22bcdf85fefe9f8b599ffa63c97013f636ad2b4f15bf8e24164312dc`.
+The driver pins the final P1-P4 independent source review `4e4991b0dfcdcfe980b2bd2655ba5bf88af6300c956c179d2e258014dd1fef4b`, reviewed-source authority `d896bce97945b9438bed6f4837fd16213530338563e3bbd728eafaa8a9fbbe09`, all 22 exact source hashes, principal readiness `14f385172f29dccf258d4be4802137724774e57b267ebbac4201a4945c01aed2`, independent readiness `50cd6d863fb3f6235af3a47fcf90fe4d21a5425c8852055b470abe9c95634f3a`, preparation-tool evidence `c329ade7d4f50a705bd6992da477870f4d1e0c3e4862feffe0f855d7c3fb243d`, native-launch notes `1ea2eabd612c94d3992f0485a9cc5ec387e4fd465e44fb1c48a97abbc06ef49c`, principal interpreter correction `10b7a1468bcc0e4f31bf9c73432be9f29eab5510df6c34a8c849e53466a76fe5`, launcher-resolution evidence `11caf55b22bcdf85fefe9f8b599ffa63c97013f636ad2b4f15bf8e24164312dc`, and the principal Windows long-path finding `2a87c254726cc52cac1069cb8b8997195c27f2885ff59318a965929962ce64e2`.
 
 Execution additionally requires explicit command-line pins for the fixed source review, source authority, both readiness reviews, this exact driver SHA, and a new `campaign-preparation-driver/independent-review.md` SHA. The independent review must contain this exact driver SHA and an explicit approval verdict. Python bytecode suppression is mandatory. All gates, all 22 current source-byte checks, exact tool-file checks, source inventory reads, quick-evidence reads, and selected-path absence checks precede project imports and every destination write.
 
@@ -30,6 +30,8 @@
 
 Repository hashes are compared before/after preview construction and before/after command rendering. The eventual output package saves exact canonical request, wire-message, and wire-schema bytes outside role/state namespaces, along with hashes, sizes, prospective token accounting, graph/parent/quick references, native config/tool identities, the policy-pinned command, and explicit `maximum_usd: null` / absent price authority. Later author and critic request bytes remain explicitly unknown because they depend on actual authorized responses and evaluation evidence.
 
+The driver now converts absolute Windows paths to the native `\\?\` or `\\?\UNC\` form only at the filesystem-call boundary. Exact reads use extended-path `lstat`/`open`/`fstat` with regular-file, reparse-point, and stable file-identity checks. Driver-owned snapshot traversal, directory enumeration, fresh-root creation, destination parent creation, exclusive `O_EXCL` writes, post-write authentication, and existence checks use the same extended-path boundary. Logical `Path` values, relative artifact references, repository-root identity inputs, containment comparisons, and report paths remain unchanged. Link/reparse rejection and create-only behavior remain fail closed; there is no truncation or missing-file bypass.
+
 The source contains no round/campaign runner, provider call, evaluator call, Docker invocation, ledger reservation, role append, admission binding, or enrollment call. It does not write or run an awake/credential launcher.
 
